# The evidence-repository clones are read-only, re-fetchable inputs
# (code/01_fetch_repos.py). Their commit hashes are recorded in
# data/raw/PROVENANCE.txt, which IS committed; the ~120MB of cloned
# working trees themselves are not, to keep this repository small and to
# avoid vendoring copies of five other repositories that already have
# their own homes (and, for icsprio and pipeline-control-validation,
# their own DOIs).
